    title: "How to Plan a Month of Facebook Page Content (Step by Step)",
    seoTitle: "How to Plan a Month of Facebook Content: A 7-Step Method",
    metaDescription: "Learn how to plan a month of Facebook Page content in seven steps: goals, themes, a posting rhythm, a calendar, and a weekly routine you can actually keep.",
    excerpt: "A practical seven-step method for planning a full month of Facebook Page posts, from choosing goals and themes to building a calendar and keeping it going.",
    category: "content-planning",
    slug: "how-to-plan-a-month-of-facebook-content",
    tags: ["facebook content plan", "content calendar", "social media planning", "small business"],
