    seoTitle: "How Often Should You Post on Facebook? A Practical Guide",
    metaDescription: "How often should you post on a Facebook Page? Learn how to choose a realistic posting frequency, test what works for your audience, and avoid burnout.",
    excerpt: "There is no magic number of Facebook posts per week. Here is how to choose a posting frequency you can keep, test it against your own results, and adjust it over time.",
    category: "content-planning",
