    seoTitle: "Meta Business Suite vs a Scheduling Tool: How to Choose",
    metaDescription: "Compare Meta Business Suite vs a scheduling tool for your Facebook Page. See what each does well, which questions to ask, and how to pick the right one.",
    excerpt: "Meta Business Suite is free and built in. A scheduling tool adds planning and writing help. Here is an honest way to decide which one fits your Page.",
